    "content": "6.  Lesson 1 Dialogue 2: Where \nare you from? \nDialogue: \n(Teacher Wang meets Jenny and 王贵 in the dining hall. She starts \nthe conversation.) \n30  |  Lesson 1 Dialogue 2: Where are you from?"
