    "content": "PART IV \nLESSON 3: MY TREAT \nLearning Objectives: \nAfter learning this lesson, you will be able to: \n•  ask and answer questions about time, day, week, and year in \nChinese. \n•  talk about birthday and age. \n• \ninvite people out for a meal. \n•  accept or refuse invitations. \n•  ask for and tell opinions. \n•  talk about favorite foods. \nLesson 3: My Treat  |  57"
