    "content": "n., year\ntime word, this year\nadv., how; to what\nextent; many\nquestion word, how\nold\nn., years old\nv., to give birth\nn., the sun, day\nn., birthday\nn., month\nn., day of a month,\nused when telling\ncalendar\nn., day, sky\nn., today\nn., week\nn., Monday\nn., Thursday\nv., to treat someone to\na meal\nwǎn shàng\nn., night, evening\nshì(er)\nchī\nwǎn fàn\nzěn me yàng\nn., thing\nv., to eat\nn., dinner\nphrase, how\nsomething is, or what\nit is like\nxiè xie\nv./n., thanks\nxīng qī wǔ\nn., Friday\ntài\ndiăn\nadv., too, excessively\nn., o’clock\n62  |  Lesson 3 Dialogue 1: Schedule a time to meet"
