    "title": "Elementary Chinese (elementary_chinese_pg122.txt) - Lesson 6 Dialogue 1: Leaving a message",
    "content": "is put before the time. For example,\n下午三点以后他回家了。(After 3:00 PM, he went home.)\n一个月以后我要去北京。(In one month, I will go to Beijing.)\n114  |  Lesson 6 Dialogue 1: Leaving a message"
